// Copy this file to Secrets.xcconfig and fill in your team, then re-run
// `xcodegen generate`. Secrets.xcconfig is gitignored and never committed.
//
//     cp Secrets.example.xcconfig Secrets.xcconfig
//
// Your Team ID is in Xcode > Settings > Accounts (select the team, then
// "Manage Certificates" shows it), or on the Membership page of the Apple
// Developer portal. It looks like a 10-character alphanumeric string.
//
// Only needed for building on a real device. Simulator builds are unsigned.
DEVELOPMENT_TEAM =
